{"id":2246,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:48","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2246"},"modified":"2025-10-03T13:22:55","modified_gmt":"2025-10-03T13:22:55","slug":"cardboard-boxes-with-window","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-with-window\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Boxes With Window"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"57\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"57\">Cardboard Boxes With Window for Packaging<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"314\">Cardboard boxes with window are an excellent solution when you want to showcase your product without opening the packaging. These boxes help increase visibility, attract customer attention, and add a clean presentation to the overall packaging experience.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"316\" data-end=\"583\">At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"341\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a>, we specialize in <strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"398\">custom cardboard boxes with window<\/strong> at wholesale prices. Whether you need small display boxes or larger containers with a clear window, we offer complete customization, including printing, coating, and structural design.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"856\">These boxes are available in kraft or white cardboard, with options for die-cut windows on one or multiple panels. You can choose from different window shapes and sizes based on your product layout. We offer free design support, fast turnaround, and bulk order discounts.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"861\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"916\">Why Cardboard Boxes With Window Are in High Demand<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"954\">A Smart Way to Showcase Products<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1140\">Cardboard boxes with a transparent window help give a sneak peek of the product inside. This makes them an excellent option for display packaging, retail shelves, and promotional kits.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<li data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1173\">\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1173\">Improves product presentation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1217\">\n<p data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1217\">Builds customer trust by showing contents<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1266\">\n<p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1266\">Reduces need for additional labels or previews<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<p data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1310\">Great for branding in retail environments<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1448\">Whether used for baked goods, beauty items, or product samples, these boxes add value without increasing packaging weight or complexity.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1487\">Available in All Sizes and Styles<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1641\">You can customize the box dimensions and choose where the window is placed\u2014top, front, or side. We offer complete flexibility with design and structure.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1794\">\n<li data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1678\">\n<p data-start=\"1645\" data-end=\"1678\">Custom die-cut shapes for windows<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1709\">\n<p data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1709\">Clear PVC window film option<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1757\">\n<p data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1757\">Tuck-end, sleeve, and mailer styles available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1794\">\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1794\">Flat or assembled shipping formats<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1883\">Boxes are easy to assemble and hold their shape well, even after stacking or transport.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1888\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1890\" data-end=\"1926\">Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1928\" data-end=\"2117\">Cardboard packaging is never one-size-fits-all. That\u2019s why <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-postal-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4627\" data-end=\"4728\"><strong data-start=\"4628\" data-end=\"4654\">Cardboard Postal Boxes<\/strong><\/a>\u2014like display, mailing, food, or cosmetics\u2014are developed with different styles and materials.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2168\">Cardboard Boxes With Window Wholesale Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2321\">If you require large volumes, our <strong data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2245\">cardboard boxes with window wholesale<\/strong> program provides bulk pricing, consistent quality, and flexible production.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2481\">\n<li data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2349\">\n<p data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2349\">MOQ as low as 100 boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2396\">\n<p data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2396\">Tier-based discounts for high-volume orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2436\">\n<p data-start=\"2400\" data-end=\"2436\">Free shipping on eligible quantities<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2481\">\n<p data-start=\"2440\" data-end=\"2481\">Stock availability for fast repeat orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2564\">Wholesale buyers benefit from lower per-unit costs and priority production slots.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2621\">Cardboard Boxes With Window Empty and Ready to Fill<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2623\" data-end=\"2769\">We also offer <strong data-start=\"2637\" data-end=\"2674\">cardboard boxes with window empty<\/strong>\u2014delivered flat-packed and unprinted for customers who want to fill and label boxes themselves.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2932\">\n<li data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2819\">\n<p data-start=\"2773\" data-end=\"2819\">Great for home-based businesses and DIY brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2820\" data-end=\"2861\">\n<p data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2861\">Available in plain brown or white board<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2886\">\n<p data-start=\"2864\" data-end=\"2886\">Quick to fold and seal<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2932\">\n<p data-start=\"2889\" data-end=\"2932\">Ideal for seasonal kits and event packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"3020\">These boxes give a clean, presentable look with less handling and quicker fulfillment.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3025\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3059\">Pricing Breakdown and Options<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3187\">Below is a sample pricing range for commonly ordered sizes. Prices may vary based on print, coating, and window customization.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"group relative\">\n<div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto md:max-w-[90vw] border-borderMain\/50 ring-borderMain\/50 divide-borderMain\/50 dark:divide-borderMainDark\/50 dark:ring-borderMainDark\/50 dark:border-borderMainDark\/50 bg-transparent\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Features<\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions<\/td>\n<td>Available in custom sizes, small to extra-large with die-cut windows<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft Paperboard, Corrugated Board<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Window cut-outs, Clear PVC film<\/td>\n<td>Retail display packaging, food boxes, gift sets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Strength<\/td>\n<td>Durable cardboard with high tear resistance<\/td>\n<td>12pt to 28pt thickness<\/td>\n<td>Matte Lamination, Gloss Lamination<\/td>\n<td>Eco-friendly &amp; food-safe coatings<\/td>\n<td>Bakery items, cosmetics, apparel<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Styles<\/td>\n<td>Tuck end, sleeve, gable, foldable, and die-cut window styles<\/td>\n<td>Kraft, White Board, Coated Cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Soft Touch, Anti-scratch<\/td>\n<td>Locking tabs, Easy-open flaps<\/td>\n<td>Food packaging, luxury products, subscription boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing<\/td>\n<td>Full-color CMYK and PMS matching<\/td>\n<td>Offset &amp; Digital Press<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Logo branding, QR codes, Custom artwork<\/td>\n<td>Branded merchandise, promotions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Window Options<\/td>\n<td>Transparent window panels in different shapes (square, oval, custom)<\/td>\n<td>PET, PVC, Biodegradable film<\/td>\n<td>Clear Gloss, Anti-glare<\/td>\n<td>Window with foil stamping, Custom cut-out<\/td>\n<td>Showcasing products while keeping them protected<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating<\/td>\n<td>Protective coating for durability and appearance<\/td>\n<td>Kraft or White SBS<\/td>\n<td>Gloss UV, Matte UV<\/td>\n<td>Oil &amp; grease resistant coating<\/td>\n<td>Food &amp; bakery packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recyclability<\/td>\n<td>100% recyclable and eco-friendly<\/td>\n<td>FSC-certified cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Matte eco-lamination<\/td>\n<td>Soy-based inks, Compostable films<\/td>\n<td>Sustainable packaging for brands<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Durability<\/td>\n<td>Designed for both retail display and safe storage<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated E-Flute, B-Flute<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte<\/td>\n<td>Reinforced edges, Double wall (optional)<\/td>\n<td>Fragile products, bakery, electronics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MOQ (Minimum Order Quantity)<\/td>\n<td>Low MOQ available for small businesses<\/td>\n<td>From 100 units to 500,000+<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td>Bulk pricing, Auto-restocking<\/td>\n<td>Startups, retail chains, wholesalers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Services<\/td>\n<td>Free design support with custom layouts<\/td>\n<td>Digital 3D Mockups<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td>Artwork proofing, Structural design<\/td>\n<td>Personalized retail packaging solutions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Nationwide &amp; international delivery<\/td>\n<td>Flat-pack or pre-assembled<\/td>\n<td>Matte Lamination<\/td>\n<td>Pallet shipping, Bulk handling<\/td>\n<td>Global e-commerce &amp; retail packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"px-two bg-background border-border shadow-subtle pointer-coarse:opacity-100 right-xs absolute bottom-0 flex gap-2 rounded-lg border py-px opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100\">\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3705\"><em data-start=\"3619\" data-end=\"3705\">For exact quotes, please contact us with your box dimensions and print requirements.<\/em><\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"3707\" data-end=\"3710\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3712\" data-end=\"3756\">Finishing, Printing, and Material Options<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3758\" data-end=\"3788\">Premium Finishes Available<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3864\">Make your packaging visually appealing with the right finishing. We offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"4037\">\n<li data-start=\"3866\" data-end=\"3904\">\n<p data-start=\"3868\" data-end=\"3904\">Matte coating for a clean, soft look<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3939\">\n<p data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3939\">Gloss coating for vibrant colors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3940\" data-end=\"3988\">\n<p data-start=\"3942\" data-end=\"3988\">Spot UV for brand highlights or window borders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4037\">\n<p data-start=\"3991\" data-end=\"4037\">Foil stamping and embossing options on request<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4075\">Material Strength and Durability<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4077\" data-end=\"4165\">Our cardboard boxes use strong paperboard to maintain structure with or without content.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4287\">\n<li data-start=\"4167\" data-end=\"4200\">\n<p data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4200\">Kraft, SBS, or recycled options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4201\" data-end=\"4225\">\n<p data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4225\">14pt to 28pt thickness<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4226\" data-end=\"4257\">\n<p data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4257\">Food-safe materials available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4287\">\n<p data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4287\">Eco-friendly and recyclable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"4289\" data-end=\"4292\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4294\" data-end=\"4337\">Application Areas and Product Categories<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"4339\" data-end=\"4364\">Who Uses Window Boxes<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4438\">These boxes are widely used in several sectors. Here are a few examples:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4561\">\n<li data-start=\"4440\" data-end=\"4466\">\n<p data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4466\">Bakeries and food brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4499\">\n<p data-start=\"4469\" data-end=\"4499\">Cosmetic and skincare products<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4528\">\n<p data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4528\">Apparel and gift packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4561\">\n<p data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4561\">Subscription boxes and PR kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4563\" data-end=\"4791\">You can also explore other mailing and retail options under our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-For-Specific-Uses\/\"><strong data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2024\">Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses <\/strong><\/a>, especially for e-commerce or safe delivery purposes.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4793\" data-end=\"4796\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4833\">Design Support and Bulk Ordering<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4835\" data-end=\"4901\">You don\u2019t need to be a designer to get custom packaging. We offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"5050\">\n<li data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"4941\">\n<p data-start=\"4905\" data-end=\"4941\">Free design support with every order<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"4986\">\n<p data-start=\"4944\" data-end=\"4986\">Fast production times (7\u201310 business days)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5013\">\n<p data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5013\">Free nationwide delivery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5014\" data-end=\"5050\">\n<p data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5050\">No setup charges for bulk printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5052\" data-end=\"5137\">Our boxes are ready for retail shelves, pop-up events, mailers, and promotional kits.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5139\" data-end=\"5142\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5317\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5178\">Need custom display packaging?<\/strong> Contact us today for a fast quote and explore our <strong data-start=\"5229\" data-end=\"5260\">Cardboard Boxes With Window<\/strong> options that fit your brand, budget, and shipping needs.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers high-quality cardboard boxes with windows at wholesale prices. We provide custom sizes and styles, along with a range of coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV. Our premium materials and printing options ensure durability and great presentation. Get started with your custom boxes today.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2386,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2246","product","type-product","